; A strip 60 x 10 x 0.8 mm along x, clamped at x < 1, a 0.07 N tip load along -z at x > 59.
; E 2000 MPa. Cantilever: tip rotation P L^2 / (2 E I) = 0.07 * 59^2 / (2 * 2000 * 0.4267) = 0.143 rad = 8.2 deg
; (end load spread over the last mm). Past the ~5 deg linear kinematics allow: the study must warn "large rotation".
; truth: stiff holds about 5.5 (beam, P L^3 / 3 E I, L 58 to 59: 5.33 to 5.62; its rotation 8.2 deg, past the linear limit)
(import "std")
(def part (move (box 60 10 0.8) 30 0 0))
(study s (shape part) (elastic (E 2000MPa) (nu 0.3) (yield 50MPa)) (fix root (- x 1)) (load tip (force 0 0 -0.07N) (region (- 59 x))) (res 0.6))
(require stiff (max-displacement s < 20))
